      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The illusion of efficiency offered by these AI overlords is nothing more than gilded cage for the American spirit. These tech behemoths don't serve the people; they serve their stock prices and the algorithms that profit from our compliance. We must violently reject this digital feudalism and reclaim the messy, imperfect sovereignty of the individual. Only by dismantling these corporate-AI structures can we restore true self-governance to this nation.",
